    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        2 Kings 11.21—12.14.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Joash was seven years old when he began to reign, and he reigned forty years in Jerusalem; his mother's name was Zibiah of Beer-sheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Joash did what was right in the eyes of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " all the days of Jehoiada the priest. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehoiada got for him two wives, and he had sons and daughters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After this Joash decided to restore the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he gathered the priests and the Levites, and said to them, “Go out to the cities of Judah, and gather from all Israel money to repair the house of your God from year to year; and see that you hasten the matter.” But the Levites did not hasten it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the king summoned Jehoiada the chief, and said to him, “Why have you not required the Levites to bring in from Judah and Jerusalem the tax levied by Moses, the servant of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", on",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Compare Vg: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the congregation of Israel for the tent of testimony?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the sons of Athaliah, that wicked woman, had broken into the house of God; and had also used all the dedicated things of the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " for the Baals.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the king commanded, and they made a chest, and set it outside the gate of the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And proclamation was made throughout Judah and Jerusalem, to bring in for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the tax that Moses the servant of God laid upon Israel in the wilderness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And all the princes and all the people rejoiced and brought their tax and dropped it into the chest until they had finished. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And whenever the chest was brought to the king's officers by the Levites, when they saw that there was much money in it, the king's secretary and the officer of the chief priest would come and empty the chest and take it and return it to its place. Thus they did day after day, and collected money in abundance. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the king and Jehoiada gave it to those who had charge of the work of the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and they hired masons and carpenters to restore the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and also workers in iron and bronze to repair the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So those who were engaged in the work labored, and the repairing went forward in their hands, and they restored the house of God to its proper condition and strengthened it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when they had finished, they brought the rest of the money before the king and Jehoiada, and with it were made utensils for the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", both for the service and for the burnt offerings, and dishes for incense, and vessels of gold and silver. And they offered burnt offerings in the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " continually all the days of Jehoiada.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Jehoiada grew old and full of days, and died; he was a hundred and thirty years old at his death. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they buried him in the city of David among the kings, because he had done good in Israel, and toward God and his house.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now after the death of Jehoiada the princes of Judah came and did obeisance to the king; then the king harkened to them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they forsook the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of their fathers, and served the Asherim and the idols. And wrath came upon Judah and Jerusalem for this their guilt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet he sent prophets among them to bring them back to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; these testified against them, but they would not give heed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the Spirit of God took possession of",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24.20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "clothed itself with",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Zechariah the son of Jehoiada the priest; and he stood above the people, and said to them, “Thus says God, ‘Why do you transgress the commandments of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", so that you cannot prosper? Because you have forsaken the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", he has forsaken you.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they conspired against him, and by command of the king they stoned him with stones in the court of the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus Joash the king did not remember the kindness which Jehoiada, Zechariah's father, had shown him, but killed his son. And when he was dying, he said, “May the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " see and avenge!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
