        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they had departed from him, leaving him severely wounded, his servants conspired against him because of the blood of the son",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24.25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Vg: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "sons",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of Jehoiada the priest, and slew him on his bed. So he died; and they buried him in the city of David, but they did not bury him in the tombs of the kings. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Those who conspired against him were Zabad the son of Shime-ath the Ammonitess, and Jehozabad the son of Shimrith the Moabitess. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Accounts of his sons, and of the many oracles against him, and of the rebuilding",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24.27",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "founding",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of the house of God are written in the Commentary on the Book of the Kings. And Amaziah his son reigned in his stead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.27"
            ]
